<title>UK: Amersham H1 pretax profit rises 43 pct.</title>
<headline>Amersham H1 pretax profit rises 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		27.5		   vs 20.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs 4.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     28.4		   vs 19.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   183.1		  vs 163.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Health science group Amersham International Plc said the trading outlook is good and that results in the second half will also benefit from the final step up in the group's investment in Nihon Medi-Physics to 50 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
